@@# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@@# Template for frappe-bench/.claude/settings.json — rendered by
@@# ./initialize.sh when Claude Code is installed in the container.
@@#   @@VENDORED_DENY_JSON@@  Edit/Write deny rules for frappe + every default app
